<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 71,613.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 71,613.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Nov 26 totaled 71,613 bales, up from 71,520 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 93 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 2,124 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
